      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-29T12:26:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The pages on the forum are set to cache for a long time, and they don't get reloaded based on your login status. So you may be logged out and go to a page, then log in, then go back to the page and it says you're logged out. Force-reloading the page will work.</p><p><span>This happens to me a lot =)</span></p>",
